{"steps": [{"type": "decision", "content": "提交 v7 的 structured-notes：在 v6 的抽取与检索之上，新增原文锚点校验——每条笔记必须能定位到源文的具体字符区间，定位不到的按实报告为 unsupported，不用模糊匹配凑。这一条借鉴 langextract 的 char_interval 做法：抽取项没有可靠区间就降级，而不是让下游当它成立。"}, {"type": "tool_call", "name": "bash", "purpose": "本地回归：锚点校验的九类判定", "input": "python -m unittest discover -s tests", "cwd": "v7-structured-notes"}, {"type": "tool_result", "exit_code": 0, "seconds": 1.0, "output": ".........\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 9 tests in 0.049s\n\nOK\n"}, {"type": "tool_call", "name": "bash", "purpose": "锚点校验：唯一命中补全、编造引文判 unsupported", "input": "python scripts/anchors.py examples/input/notes-demo.json examples/input/notes-source.md work/anchors.json", "cwd": "v7-structured-notes"}, {"type": "tool_result", "exit_code": 1, "seconds": 0.9, "output": "{\"total\": 3, \"anchored\": 0, \"repaired\": 2, \"ambiguous\": 0, \"unsupported\": 1, \"supported\": 2, \"all_anchored\": false, \"unsupported_ids\": [\"N3\"], \"ambiguous_ids\": [], \"sources\": [\"notes-source.md\"]}\n"}, {"type": "observation", "exit_code": 0, "content": "读回上一步产物：{'total': 3, 'anchored': 0, 'repaired': 2, 'ambiguous': 0, 'unsupported': 1, 'supported': 2, 'all_anchored': False, 'unsupported_ids': ['N3'], 'ambiguous_ids': [], 'sources': ['notes-source.md']}\n[('N1', 'repaired', 'unique_match'), ('N2', 'repaired', 'unique_match'), ('N3', 'unsupported', 'no_match')]"}, {"type": "observation", "content": "已知边界：区间是解码后文本的字符偏移，不是字节偏移；同一引文出现多次记 ambiguous 并列出候选，不代为选定；匹配只做字面与空白归一化，不做语义匹配。unsupported 的条目保留在报告里，不从笔记集中删除。"}]}
